# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SpanishTax AI Worker — Local development credentials
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .dev.vars (no extension difference, just the name).
# .dev.vars is gitignored — it's for `wrangler dev` local testing.
#
# In production, use `wrangler secret put` for each variable.

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here
VOYAGE_API_KEY=your-voyage-api-key-here
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
